      "rationale": "Across all four datasets, halve the training-frequency feature amplitude to reduce popularity distortion while retaining its context cue. Existing checkpointed scales ensure consistent inference; padding and mask scales remain one. Preserve embeddings, topology, readout, loss and optimizer.",
